{"id":"marca","lemma":"marca","pos":"noun","rank":1160,"glosses":["brand (of clothing etc.)","brand (for cattle)","mark (left on a surface)"],"ipa":"/ˈmaɾka/","gender":"f","forms":{"plural":"marcas"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/f/ff/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-Marreromarco-marca.wav","examples":[{"text":"Ponga una marca en esta página.","en":"Put a mark on this page.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/594641","words":[{"g":"to put, to place","l":"poner"},{"g":"a"},null,{"g":"in / on"},{"g":"this","l":"este"},{"g":"page"}]},{"text":"Mire lo que marca la caja.","en":"Look and see how much the cash register rings up.","words":[{"g":"to look at","l":"mirar"},null,null,null,{"g":"the / her"},{"g":"box, case"}],"phrases":[[1,3,"what, that which"]]},{"text":"¿Cuál es tu marca de jabón favorita?","en":"What's your favorite brand of soap?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/611067","words":[{"g":"which one, what, which"},{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},{"g":"your"},null,{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"soap"},{"g":"favorite/favourite","l":"favorito"}]},{"text":"¿Qué marca prefieres?","en":"Which brand do you prefer?","words":[{"g":"what"},null,{"g":"to prefer","l":"preferir"}]},{"text":"¿Hay alguna marca que lo distinga?","en":"Does it have a distinguishing mark?","words":[{"g":"to have","l":"haber"},{"g":"someone","l":"alguno"},null,{"g":"that"},{"g":"it / him"},null]}]}